WEBVTT

00:00:02.830 --> 00:00:06.340
Who is that? Who? Who?

00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:12.610
That is the devil! Devilman! Devilman!

00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:14.410
DEVILMAN

00:00:14.410 --> 00:00:21.880
This man took on the name "traitor"
He threw away everything to fight

00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:25.660
His Devil Arrow is a supersonic wave
His Devil Ears can hear anything

00:00:25.790 --> 00:00:29.330
His Devil Wing lets him fly through the air
His Devil Beam is a ray of heat

00:00:29.530 --> 00:00:36.270
With the power of a devil inside him

00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:45.180
He's a hero who fights for justice
Devilman Devilman

00:00:48.940 --> 00:00:56.290
This man first learned of human love
That kindness awakened him

00:00:56.590 --> 00:01:00.530
His Devil Chop has punching power
His Devil Kick has destructive power

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:04.190
His Devil Eye has X-ray power
His Devil Cutter can break through rocks

00:01:04.460 --> 00:01:11.340
With the power of a devil inside him

00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:20.210
He's a hero who fights for justice
Devilman Devilman

00:01:32.090 --> 00:01:37.700
DEMON DREMOON
THE MOON IS HELL

00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:50.570
Not one human realizes anything.

00:01:50.570 --> 00:01:55.570
The first animal that noticed the occurrence
must have been a seagull or a fish.

00:01:56.980 --> 00:02:00.760
Unfortunately, they have
no words to tell anyone.

00:02:09.290 --> 00:02:11.030
Haul the boat ashore!

00:02:23.870 --> 00:02:28.580
It's weird for the tide to come in this fast.

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:30.180
Look at that!

00:02:37.820 --> 00:02:40.800
The lion-rock usually doesn't
sink, even in the high tide.

00:03:16.860 --> 00:03:19.400
SUBWAY

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:32.640
The water rose so quickly, it
was almost like a storm surge.

00:03:32.640 --> 00:03:37.220
Extensive damage has been done not
only to Tokyo, but Osaka as well.

00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:42.800
Sapporo as well.

00:03:45.390 --> 00:03:46.790
Even Hiroshima.

00:03:46.790 --> 00:03:50.030
All Japan is flooded.

00:03:52.190 --> 00:03:54.570
How can there be a flood,
when we didn't get a typhoon?

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:04.270
Hey Tare, this is from your mother.

00:04:04.270 --> 00:04:06.450
Thank you!

00:04:08.410 --> 00:04:11.280
Hey, do you know
what caused this flood?

00:04:11.280 --> 00:04:13.760
I guess it's because you
always wet yourself.

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:17.220
N-No way, not even I could...

00:04:17.220 --> 00:04:18.720
Don't insult me!

00:04:22.290 --> 00:04:25.230
The water demon
Mermaim died awhile ago.

00:04:25.230 --> 00:04:28.270
There's no other demon who can
manipulate water like that.

00:04:41.680 --> 00:04:45.680
The Amazon has dried up,
I heard it over the radio.

00:04:46.980 --> 00:04:49.430
Many of the oceans have disappointed.

00:04:49.990 --> 00:04:51.930
South America has dried completely!

00:04:53.290 --> 00:04:56.420
South America is on the opposite
side of the globe from Japan.

00:04:56.420 --> 00:04:58.690
I guess that means...

00:04:58.690 --> 00:05:03.640
Yes. I don't know why, but all
that water has converged on Japan.

00:05:08.040 --> 00:05:11.240
The more ocean gathers,
the more the fish gather.

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:16.850
I'll angle sea breams, eels, and
globefish. I'll have herring roe, too!

00:05:19.710 --> 00:05:21.630
I got one!

00:05:24.790 --> 00:05:26.930
A man-eating shark!

00:05:30.890 --> 00:05:32.530
It's starting to drain out!

00:05:32.530 --> 00:05:35.600
You're right, we're saved!

00:05:38.030 --> 00:05:40.130
But they can't feel relieved yet.

00:05:40.140 --> 00:05:44.740
The flood tied damages are
moving slowly eastward.

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:48.880
After half a month, the sea
around Japan disappeared.

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:50.280
Everyone was aware

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:54.680
that such a phenomenon had
never occurred before.

00:05:54.680 --> 00:05:58.250
Wars stopped in Vietnam and in Israel.

00:05:58.250 --> 00:06:01.820
People all over the world
were seized with fear.

00:06:01.820 --> 00:06:04.800
The cause of the phenomenon was...

00:06:05.530 --> 00:06:06.870
the moon!

00:06:12.530 --> 00:06:17.540
The moon! Yes, the moon is
drawing closer to Earth!

00:06:18.440 --> 00:06:21.840
As lunar gravity
increases, high tides occur.

00:06:21.840 --> 00:06:24.450
The moon seals mankind's fate.

00:06:26.580 --> 00:06:30.180
Mr. Alphonne, school is closed.

00:06:30.190 --> 00:06:32.720
You're not gonna make overtime
no matter how long you stay.

00:06:33.860 --> 00:06:36.260
You're tardy! Out in hall!

00:06:36.260 --> 00:06:38.760
But sir...

00:06:38.760 --> 00:06:40.740
Out in the hall!

00:06:41.230 --> 00:06:44.770
What has become of him, I wonder?

00:06:44.770 --> 00:06:47.670
Poor Mr. Alphonne has finally lost it.

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:50.380
He thinks I'm one of his students
and is making me stand in the hall.

00:06:53.010 --> 00:06:56.580
Anyway, since I'm one of his students,
I'd better stand out here!

00:06:56.580 --> 00:07:00.720
I'm a first year student.
My name is Kiyohiko Todoroki.

00:07:01.180 --> 00:07:05.630
We'll see about that.
Bow!

00:07:06.020 --> 00:07:11.020
If I go to the ocean...

00:07:11.730 --> 00:07:16.730
a corpse will wash up on shore!

00:07:17.930 --> 00:07:22.500
If I go to the mountain...

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:26.840
Everyone's gone crazy! Then again, they
were all kind of crazy from the start.

00:07:26.840 --> 00:07:30.510
This is the end of our
prestigious Nakado Academy.

00:07:30.510 --> 00:07:33.550
Akira, what's gonna happen to us?

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:36.030
I don't have a clue.

00:07:36.520 --> 00:07:41.520
I heard on the news that all the
trains in New York have derailed.

00:07:41.760 --> 00:07:43.520
They were pulled by lunar gravity.

00:07:43.530 --> 00:07:45.630
I can't figure it out.

00:07:45.630 --> 00:07:48.630
No, I think the answer is simple.

00:07:49.700 --> 00:07:54.150
All of us will be pulled up into
the air at the next full moon!

00:08:28.340 --> 00:08:30.540
Akira!

00:08:30.540 --> 00:08:32.350
Miki!

00:08:32.840 --> 00:08:34.480
Akira!

00:08:34.880 --> 00:08:35.980
Miki!

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:47.030
- Akira.

00:08:51.660 --> 00:08:54.200
Is this the end for us?

00:08:55.100 --> 00:08:56.510
It seems that way.

00:09:24.160 --> 00:09:26.230
Gravity, gravity...

00:09:26.230 --> 00:09:28.400
What are you talking about?

00:09:28.400 --> 00:09:30.200
They taught us at school.

00:09:30.200 --> 00:09:33.700
The tides happen because of the
moon's gravitational pull, right?

00:09:40.180 --> 00:09:41.680
Damn!

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:45.610
It's him!

00:09:45.610 --> 00:09:47.560
Demon Dremoon!

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:49.690
What's wrong, Akira?

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:52.970
Dammit, where the hell is he?!

00:09:58.930 --> 00:10:02.310
Someone help!
Akira has lost it!

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:05.230
Dremoon is manipulating the gravity!

00:10:05.230 --> 00:10:08.340
There's no mistake!
He's bringing the moon closer to Earth!

00:10:13.980 --> 00:10:18.290
DEVIL!

00:10:20.980 --> 00:10:22.790
Devil Wing!

00:10:24.950 --> 00:10:28.830
He can't be that hard to find.
The moon is always drawn to him.

00:10:33.230 --> 00:10:35.470
Wherever the full moon is,
that's where he'll be.

00:10:38.730 --> 00:10:40.770
Is that what's left of Waikiki?

00:10:44.570 --> 00:10:47.920
It's the full moon!
He must be hiding nearby.

00:10:51.050 --> 00:10:52.810
Where are you Dremoon? Come out!

00:10:52.810 --> 00:10:54.450
Show yourself and fight!

00:11:26.550 --> 00:11:31.550
That Devilman must be
searching for Dremoon!

00:11:32.320 --> 00:11:37.320
You cannot find Dremoon. Go on
searching as much as you want!

00:11:38.130 --> 00:11:41.940
And realize your foolishness, Devilman!

00:11:45.030 --> 00:11:47.300
Impossible, he's not here!

00:11:47.300 --> 00:11:50.080
Demon Dremoon, where the hell are you?

00:11:53.610 --> 00:11:55.020
Dammit!

00:12:03.950 --> 00:12:07.050
I think I've been mistaken all this time.

00:12:07.060 --> 00:12:08.990
Maybe the moon isn't
getting closer to Earth.

00:12:08.990 --> 00:12:10.990
Could it be the other way around?

00:12:33.610 --> 00:12:34.980
That bastard is on the moon!

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:38.400
He's trying to destroy Earth
by bringing it to the moon!

00:12:52.170 --> 00:12:53.580
TIGER PRO

00:12:57.910 --> 00:12:58.540
STEREO

00:13:41.150 --> 00:13:43.920
As long as I'm here,
I won't allow that to happen!

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:46.900
If he's on the moon, then I will go there!

00:13:57.670 --> 00:13:59.770
Miki, go to bed.

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:02.740
You won't be able to sleep
if the flood comes again.

00:14:02.740 --> 00:14:04.410
Look, it happened again tonight.

00:14:05.270 --> 00:14:07.440
You go to bed first, Tare.

00:14:07.440 --> 00:14:10.420
You're waiting for Akira
to come back, right?

00:14:11.810 --> 00:14:12.950
That's right.

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:15.520
I want to be with Akira,
even if just for a moment,

00:14:15.520 --> 00:14:18.430
in case our lives end
at the next full moon.

00:14:19.720 --> 00:14:20.820
Listen to you!

00:14:20.820 --> 00:14:25.530
Do as you like!
If you'll excuse me, I'll be in bed!

00:14:29.630 --> 00:14:32.940
Don't worry, I'm sure he'll be back soon.

00:14:33.770 --> 00:14:34.940
Thank you.

00:14:35.900 --> 00:14:37.180
Goodnight.

00:14:38.070 --> 00:14:41.210
Will we see each
other in the morning, Miki?

00:14:41.210 --> 00:14:43.690
We have three whole
days until the full moon.

00:14:48.320 --> 00:14:49.520
Three days.

00:14:50.590 --> 00:14:51.460
Akira.

00:14:53.020 --> 00:14:55.590
I'm going to die in three days.

00:15:00.360 --> 00:15:02.470
I'll write to Miyo.

00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:07.600
I'll wrote a note to Tare.

00:15:07.600 --> 00:15:11.000
"My Tare..."

00:15:11.010 --> 00:15:15.080
“Sorry to die before you...“

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:17.150
No, that sounds all wrong.

00:15:20.350 --> 00:15:24.990
"My Miyo m"

00:15:26.220 --> 00:15:28.890
"Farewell..."

00:15:29.860 --> 00:15:32.930
"It makes me sad to say..."

00:15:32.930 --> 00:15:35.530
"But I'm going to die."

00:15:36.900 --> 00:15:38.470
"| hope..."

00:15:40.740 --> 00:15:43.570
"you will be happy without me."

00:15:43.570 --> 00:15:45.340
Is this okay?

00:15:45.340 --> 00:15:48.540
Oh, that's right! Miyo will die when I do!

00:15:48.540 --> 00:15:52.890
Great, Tare's gonna die
the same time as me!

00:15:55.820 --> 00:15:57.760
That's right, everyone will die!

00:16:01.120 --> 00:16:03.490
I don't have to study or take exams!
I can't just stay here!

00:16:18.540 --> 00:16:19.980
Hairo!

00:16:20.640 --> 00:16:22.020
Chaco!

00:16:24.450 --> 00:16:26.280
We'll die in three days.

00:16:26.280 --> 00:16:28.110
Yeah, three days is all we have.

00:16:28.120 --> 00:16:30.950
I'm taking back my youth,
right here and now!

00:16:30.950 --> 00:16:32.990
I'm so happy, Hairo!

00:16:37.890 --> 00:16:40.990
Todaiji, you're just now figuring it out?

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:42.500
Congratulations!

00:16:54.710 --> 00:16:59.150
The adults are all going crazy.
The kids are the same.

00:16:59.150 --> 00:17:02.220
All I have to do is
defeat Demon Dremoon.

00:17:02.220 --> 00:17:05.160
Time to take a little trip to the moon.

00:17:05.890 --> 00:17:07.690
The moon is too far away for a round trip.

00:17:07.690 --> 00:17:09.830
With my strength, one-way
may be the most I can do.

00:17:10.660 --> 00:17:13.640
Miki, I might not see you again.

00:17:14.100 --> 00:17:15.370
Take care.

00:17:21.240 --> 00:17:22.810
So long, Miki.

00:17:25.740 --> 00:17:37.950
Akira!

00:17:55.540 --> 00:17:57.040
The satellite?

00:17:58.910 --> 00:18:00.850
Dremoon!
Dammit!

00:18:08.020 --> 00:18:09.680
Devilman!

00:18:09.680 --> 00:18:13.890
Hiding behind a satellite
in lunar orbit? Clever, Dremoon!

00:18:13.890 --> 00:18:14.920
Devilman!

00:18:14.920 --> 00:18:18.060
I'm impressed that you saw
through it, but this is the end!

00:18:18.060 --> 00:18:20.370
Dremoon!

00:18:31.510 --> 00:18:32.580
Damn!

00:18:33.310 --> 00:18:37.110
Black holes are super vacuums
that exist deep in space.

00:18:37.110 --> 00:18:39.550
These holes in my chest
have the same power.

00:18:39.550 --> 00:18:43.150
Even light cannot
escape once it enters!

00:19:05.310 --> 00:19:06.510
Damn...

00:19:22.260 --> 00:19:24.240
Devil Cutter!

00:19:29.260 --> 00:19:31.470
Devil Arrow!

00:19:33.070 --> 00:19:36.440
I'm too strong to be defeated
by such childish tricks!

00:19:36.440 --> 00:19:38.710
All right, then I'll give
you my finishing move!

00:19:39.370 --> 00:19:42.180
Devil Beam!

00:19:44.950 --> 00:19:46.420
Dremoon!

00:19:53.090 --> 00:19:54.930
Dremoon, behind you!

00:19:56.620 --> 00:19:58.400
Dremoon!

00:20:06.870 --> 00:20:08.700
It worked!

00:20:08.700 --> 00:20:12.880
Dremoon panicked
and sucked himself up!

00:20:18.750 --> 00:20:21.390
I have to hurry,
Miki is waiting for me on Earth!

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:49.840
No one knows; no one may know

00:20:51.550 --> 00:20:56.550
Who Devilman really is

00:20:57.380 --> 00:21:04.200
No one speaks; no one may say

00:21:04.630 --> 00:21:10.080
Who Devilman really is

00:21:10.900 --> 00:21:14.000
In the world of man, there is love

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:17.200
In the world of man, there are dreams

00:21:17.200 --> 00:21:22.200
Wanting only to protect
these beautiful things,

00:21:24.350 --> 00:21:33.060
Devilman is off, somewhere, today

00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:53.080
No one knows; no one may know

00:21:54.040 --> 00:21:59.320
Where Devilman comes from

00:21:59.780 --> 00:22:04.780
No one speaks; no one may say

00:22:06.920 --> 00:22:11.920
Where Devilman comes from

00:22:13.360 --> 00:22:16.700
For he can never go home again

00:22:16.700 --> 00:22:19.700
He wanders on a journey

00:22:19.700 --> 00:22:26.380
Now that he understands peace

00:22:26.810 --> 00:22:36.520
He'll be Devilman again,
somewhere, tomorrow

00:23:10.650 --> 00:23:13.690
Fantastic incidents
happen one after another.

00:23:13.690 --> 00:23:15.960
The person controlling
them behind the scenes

00:23:15.960 --> 00:23:17.820
is the Demon Tribe's final trump card:

00:23:17.830 --> 00:23:20.070
Captain of the Guard, God.

00:23:27.300 --> 00:23:32.040
He has the power to cause miracles
to happen just by praying.

00:23:32.040 --> 00:23:34.970
And he uses this as a weapon
to destroy Devilman!

00:23:34.980 --> 00:23:37.110
God is planning to conquer the world.

00:24:15.480 --> 00:24:19.820
At last, the day of destiny
has arrived for Devilman.

00:24:19.820 --> 00:24:21.720
In front of Miki,

00:24:21.720 --> 00:24:25.640
God reveals that Akira is a
demon borrowing human form!

00:24:26.490 --> 00:24:30.960
For Devilman, who betrayed the Demon
Tribe and fights them as enemies,

00:24:30.960 --> 00:24:33.930
the human world is the only
place where he can live.

00:24:33.930 --> 00:24:37.500
But now that humans
know his true identity,

00:24:37.500 --> 00:24:40.610
he decides to leave the human world

00:24:40.610 --> 00:24:43.680
and throws himself into battle with God.

00:24:43.680 --> 00:24:45.040
Next time on Devilman:

00:24:45.050 --> 00:24:48.190
DEMON GOD
THE MIRACLES OF GOD
